  title: Day 4
  text: "The spirits have realized that wearing a colored mask made them vulnerable.
    We don\u2019t know what behavior they might adopt now, so stay cautious. No more
    yellow masks have been spotted, they\u2019ve finally lost interest in their pranks.  "
